d protected from the same threats that destroyed the original data.\n\nBelow is a comprehensive guide to designing a professional-grade backup system.\n\n---\n\n### 1. The Foundational Strategy: The 3-2-1 Rule\nBefore choosing tools, adhere to the industry standard for data redundancy:\n*   **3 Copies of Data:** One primary copy and two backups.\n*   **2 Different Media Types:** (e.g", "elapsed_s": 3.7962297510239296, "ttft_s": 0.5772483830223791, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 128, "prompt_tokens": 55, "total_tokens": 183, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "timings": {"cache_n": 0, "prompt_n": 55, "prompt_ms": 472.136, "prompt_per_token_ms": 8.58429090909091, "prompt_per_second": 116.49185827812325, "predicted_n": 128, "predicted_ms": 3218.916, "predicted_per_token_ms": 25.345795275590554, "predicted_per_second": 39.45427591151804}, "finish_reason": "length", "decode_tps_client": 39.45347471173646, "end_to_end_output_tps": 33.71766420761954, "full_output_budget": true}], "decode_tps_client_median": 39.45347471173646, "ttft_s_median": 0.5772483830223791, "pass": true, "distinct_output_texts": 3}, "long": {"tier": "development", "anchor": {"text": "BOLT-7319-CEDAR", "elapsed_s": 11.514302093011793, "ttft_s": null, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 11, "prompt_tokens": 8238, "total_tokens": 8249, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "timings": {"cache_n": 0, "prompt_n": 8238, "prompt_ms": 11185.038, "prompt_per_token_ms": 1.3577370721048798, "prompt_per_second": 736.5196255926891, "predicted_n": 11, "predicted_ms": 262.958, "predicted_per_token_ms": 26.295800000000003, "predicted_per_second": 38.0288867423695}, "finish_reason": "stop", "decode_tps_client": null, "end_to_end_output_tps": 0.9553336286596188, "full_output_budget": false}, "warmup": {"text": "Designing a reliable file backup system requires a shift in mindset from simply \"copying files\" to implementing a **data resilience strategy**. The goal is not just to have a copy of your data